OL,3,GNEWSAIs bankrupt competitions boss
OL,4,Abehind new scheme?
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Ami Shuttleworth and her fiance
OL,7,FChris Smith were told they had won
OL,8,F#10,000 in a pay-to-enter competition,
OL,9,Fthey immediately knew how they would
OL,10,Fspend their prize.
OL,12,F"We were over the moon, our wedding was
OL,13,Fgoing to be paid off," recalls the
OL,14,F34-year-old mother-of-one from
OL,15,FMiddlesbrough.
OL,17,FMel Higgins, 33, also had big plans for
OL,18,Fthe #5,000 she was told she had won.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
